{"words": [{"text": "كَيْفَ", "translation": "How"}, {"text": "تَكْفُرُونَ", "translation": "(can) you disbelieve"}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translation": "in Allah"}, {"text": "وَكُنتُمْ", "translation": "While you were"}, {"text": "أَمْوَٰتًۭا", "translation": "dead"}, {"text": "فَأَحْيَـٰكُمْ ۖ", "translation": "then He gave you life"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "يُمِيتُكُمْ", "translation": "He will cause you to die"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "يُحْيِيكُمْ", "translation": "He will give you life"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "إِلَيْهِ", "translation": "to Him"}, {"text": "تُرْجَعُونَ", "translation": "you will be returned"}], "sahih": "How can you disbelieve in Allāh when you were lifeless and He brought you to life; then He will cause you to die, then He will bring you [back] to life, and then to Him you will be returned."}